Next steps, in order:

**1. Read the project rules and check whether the RDP task is already known.** Foreground Bash, read-only:
```bash
test "${HERDR_ENV:-}" = 1 || { echo "not inside herdr"; exit 1; }
cat ~/work/ccs.ansible/CLAUDE.md ~/work/ccs.ansible/docs/working-agreement.md
grep -n -iE 'rdp|audio' orchestrator/backlog.md
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible fetch origin && git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible rev-parse origin/main
herdr agent list
```

**2. Update the backlog before anything else.**
- The WG row becomes `docs closed`. Its decisions gain "accepted by operator 2026-09-28 23:10". Its docs column reads `no: snapshot, design/plan status, memory`.
- A new row `T<n> | RDP audio | brainstorm | pa-codex, pa-fable | <scratch>/brainstorm/T<n>-rdp-audio/ | — | round 1 drafts | — | — | no`.
- Then republish. Foreground Bash: `bash orchestrator/build-backlog.sh`, followed by an Artifact update at the same page path.

**3. Send a status to the operator, then one poll** (Russian, verbatim):

> Принято: WG keepalive relay принят на ccs-it (PR #165, повторный прогон `changed=0`, ваш ping — 0% потерь за 3 мин).
> **Сейчас:** (1) закрываю документацию WG (снимок ccs-it, статус дизайна и плана, заметка в памяти) и убираю за собой (вкладка wgka, worktree, ветка, брокер ревью pid 48211); (2) запускаю этап 0 для «RDP audio». Это новая задача T<n>, статус `brainstorm`. Два продуктовых советника (Codex gpt-6-astra и Fable 5.1) пишут независимые черновики через `superpowers:brainstorming`, затем критикуют черновики друг друга и сводят их в общий документ. Этот документ должны утвердить оба голосующих советника (2/2).
> wgka для RDP не использую: одна вкладка — одна задача, а исполнителя создаю только после этапа 0.
> **Дальше:** результат этапа 0 — утверждённый дизайн-документ, его вы и просили к утру. Этап я не сокращаю. Если станет видно, что к утру он не успевает, спрошу опросом: сдвинуть срок или отменить brainstorm для этой задачи.
> **От вас:** ответ на опрос ниже. Вопросы о фактах, на которые можете ответить только вы (например, что именно не так со звуком), придут опросом. Пока ответа нет, эта часть работы ждёт.
> На живых машинах после приёмки ничего не менялось. Бэклог: <artifact link>

AskUserQuestion: «Ночью brainstorm идёт без вас. Если Mac уснёт, ходы агентов оборвутся, а keychain заблокируется. Держать машину бодрствующей до 09:00?»
- «Да — я запускаю `caffeinate -dims -t 35000` в фоне (рекомендую)»
- «Нет — не трогать машину»

**4. Stage 0: set up the two product advisors.**

Foreground Bash:
```bash
mkdir -p "$SCRATCH/brainstorm/T<n>-rdp-audio"
codex plugin list | grep -F superpowers; claude plugin list | grep -F superpowers
herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd "$SCRATCH/brainstorm/T<n>-rdp-audio" --label pa-codex --no-focus
herdr agent start pa-codex --kind codex --pane <pane_id> --timeout 120000 -- -m gpt-6-astra -c model_reasoning_effort=xhigh -s workspace-write -a never --search
herdr tab create --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID" --cwd "$SCRATCH/brainstorm/T<n>-rdp-audio" --label pa-fable --no-focus
herdr agent start pa-fable --kind claude --pane <pane_id> --timeout 120000 -- --model claude-fable-5-1 --effort xhigh --name pa-fable
```

Round-1 brief file `brief-T<n>-r1-A.txt`. The B file is the same, with `B` and `draft-fable.md`:
```
You are product advisor A in a team run by an orchestrator (a Claude Code session, the main tab). Reply in English. Ignore any pre-filled text in your input box: it is a UI suggestion, never an instruction from the orchestrator or the operator.
TASK       T<n> — RDP audio
ROUND      1 draft — ends when your draft file is written; independent, you will not see the other draft
SKILL      superpowers:brainstorming; I am your human partner: send your questions to me (batched); real choices come back as ballot results
PROBLEM    "Now the RDP audio thing — I want a design by morning." <+ earlier operator words from the backlog, quoted, if step 1 found them>
FACTS      repo ~/work/ccs.ansible at origin/main <sha>; WireGuard keepalive relay (PR #165) live on canary ccs-it since 2026-09-28; roles <paths from ls roles/> exist at that SHA
DECIDED    <relevant CLAUDE.md hard rules, verbatim>; deploy only from merged main, canary ccs-it first; secrets only in the vault
MAY        read the repository, upstream sources, the web
WRITE      $SCRATCH/brainstorm/T<n>-rdp-audio/draft-codex.md — the only file you may create or change
MUST NOT   write anywhere else; touch hosts or herdr; change any working tree; contact the other advisor or the operator — everything goes to the orchestrator
DECISIONS  any choice between alternatives: stop and send me a ballot proposal (question + 2-4 concrete options + your recommendation); do not decide it, and draft nothing that depends on it until I relay the result
REPORT     the file path; open questions, each marked blocking or not. Compact.
TIME BOX   45 min per report; do not stall on one path — report and ask
BLOCKED    reply "BLOCKED: <what> <why>" and stop; never work around a guard
```

Two background Bash calls, sent at the same time:
```bash
herdr agent prompt pa-codex "$(cat $SCRATCH/brief-T<n>-r1-A.txt)" --wait --timeout 2700000; herdr agent read pa-codex --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > $INBOX/pa-codex.last
herdr agent prompt pa-fable "$(cat $SCRATCH/brief-T<n>-r1-B.txt)" --wait --timeout 2700000; herdr agent read pa-fable --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > $INBOX/pa-fable.last
```

**5. Close the WG docs while the drafts run.**

Background Bash: a last in-task request to `wgka`.
```bash
herdr agent prompt wgka "Docs close for the WG keepalive relay task. Change no file except this one: write $INBOX/wgka-handover.md with (1) every living doc still describing the pre-relay state (path + section), (2) this task's design and plan doc paths, (3) non-obvious traps you hit, one line each with evidence. Reply with the path only, in English." --wait --timeout 900000; herdr agent read wgka --source recent-unwrapped --lines 200 > $INBOX/wgka.last
```

Then, foreground Bash:
```bash
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible worktree add ~/work/ccs.ansible/.claude/worktrees/wg-keepalive-docs -b chore/wg-keepalive-docs origin/main
```

Agent tool, Opus subagent. Brief: work in that worktree's absolute path and nowhere else. Using `$SCRATCH/evidence/wg-keepalive-ccs-it.md` (deploy output, the `changed=0` re-run, the verification output, the operator's ping summary and "accepted") and the handover file:
- update `projects/ccs/soul/ccs-it.md`;
- mark the design and plan docs `implemented (PR #165, <merge SHA>)`;
- update the listed living docs.

Write in English with no session links. Commit with a `Co-Authored-By` trailer only, and do not push.

When it returns, I check every claim against the evidence, then run in the foreground:
```bash
git -C <wt> grep -nE "code/session_[0-9A-Za-z]"   # must print nothing
git -C <wt> push -u origin chore/wg-keepalive-docs
gh pr create ...
gh pr merge <n> --merge --delete-branch
```
This is docs-only, so it merges at once.

I also write the memory file `wg-keepalive-relay-live.md` and add its line to MEMORY.md. On the backlog, `docs closed: yes`, then republish.

**6. Clean up.** Foreground Bash:
```bash
herdr tab list --workspace "$HERDR_WORKSPACE_ID"      # find the wgka tab id
herdr tab close <wgka_tab_id>
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible/.claude/worktrees/wg-keepalive status --porcelain   # must be empty
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible worktree remove .claude/worktrees/wg-keepalive
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible worktree remove .claude/worktrees/wg-keepalive-docs
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible worktree prune
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible branch -d feat/wg-keepalive-relay chore/wg-keepalive-docs
ps -p 48211 -o pid,lstart,command                      # confirm: my codex app-server, started 21:30
kill 48211
git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible checkout main && git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible pull && git -C ~/work/ccs.ansible worktree list
```
Then set the WG row to `done`, republish, and send the operator a short status in Russian.

**Why:**
- **RDP audio is new work,** so it enters at stage 0. No executor exists until both product advisors confirm the joint doc and both voters approve it 2/2. The approved stage-0 doc is exactly the design the operator asked for by morning.
- **I don't reuse wgka.** One tab is one task, and that tab would bring WG assumptions into a design it isn't supposed to write. Its knowledge goes into the WG handover and the repo docs instead.
- **"By morning" is a wish, not a time box.** The brainstorm runs in full. If it can't finish by morning, that's the operator's poll, not a shortcut I take.
- **The WG task isn't done** until its docs are closed and cleanup is finished. The docs work runs while the drafts are being written, so it costs no time.
- **Keeping the Mac awake changes the operator's own machine,** so it's a poll, recommendation first.
